{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/LowestCommonAncestors"},"metadata":{"title":"LowestCommonAncestors","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14TreeAlgorithms21LowestCommonAncestorsV","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LowestCommonAncestors"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LowestCommonAncestors"}],"modules":[{"name":"TreeAlgorithms"}],"symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"fileName":"LowestCommonAncestor.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/TreeAlgorithms\/LowestCommonAncestor.swift#L76"}},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LowestCommonAncestors"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For vertices at preorder positions p < q, the answer is the vertex at the least position among"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the parents of the vertices at positions p + 1 … q: those parents lie in the answer’s subtree"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and include it, and it has the least position